# One-Stop Digital Solution

## 📌 Project Overview
The **One-Stop Digital Solution** is a platform designed to help users search, access, and navigate bureaucratic services efficiently. It provides a **personalized roadmap** based on user input, offering step-by-step guidance to streamline complex processes.


## 🛠️ Setup Guide
Follow these steps to set up and run the project on your local machine.

### **1️⃣ Prerequisites**
Ensure you have the following installed:
- **Node.js** (v16 or later) – [Download Here](https://nodejs.org/)
- **Git** – [Download Here](https://git-scm.com/)
- **VS Code (Optional)** – [Download Here](https://code.visualstudio.com/)

---

### **2️⃣ Clone the Repository**
Open your terminal and run:
```bash
 git clone  https://github.com/Ganzadidier/PSGP-WEBSITE.git
```
---

## 🔥 Deployment
To deploy the project:
- **Frontend:** Use [Vercel](https://vercel.com/) or [Netlify](https://www.netlify.com/)

## 🎯 Contribution Guide
1. Fork the repository
2. Create a new branch: `git checkout -b feature-branch`
3. Commit your changes: `git commit -m 'Add new feature'`
4. Push to your branch: `git push origin feature-branch`
5. Open a Pull Request

